SUMMARY:Sober (Curious) Monthly Coffee Walk
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Lose The Booze Crew (20-40s)\nHi friends!! Come join
  us for our monthly coffee walk around River Arts District.\n\n**We'll be 
 doing 3-4miles and leave promptly at 10:10am. Route will be same as last t
 ime\, over Haywood bridge\, then up to former French Broad park\, turn aro
 und back up to Craven St bridge\, and back to Ultra (there is active const
 ruction where French Broad Park used to be). Arrive on time or get left be
 hind.** 🫣\n\n**Important**- *Ultra's parking lot is tiny\, please do no
 t park there!!!* You can find plenty of parking on Lyman St\, Clingman Ave
  or the gravel lot for Wedge (it’s now a paid lot)\n\n**Gentle Reminder:
 ** This isn't a 12-step\, recovery group or dating mixer\, just some peopl
 e hanging out without the booze.\n\nIf your plans change\, please update y
 our RSVP status as soon as possible.\n\nWell behaved doggos are welcome bu
 t keep in mind they won't be allowed inside the coffee shop.\n\nCan't wait
  to see your beautiful faces 🤗!!
